From 2aedadb0fd1318b7a1cfe5e5cc51696c2f9befa1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rpiios <grinkod.bogdan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:00:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Raspberry Pi 3: USB mouse as touchscreen; 480x800 surface 1:1

- rpi3_usb.c: polled DWC2 host (buffer DMA, channel 0): root port,
  recursive hubs, split transactions through a hub's transaction
  translator, HID boot-protocol mouse.
- rpi3_touch.cpp: leo_touch_transport_init/poll for the HD2 HID touch
  service; mouse moves a pointer, left button is the finger.
- IOS7LeoHIDTouch.cpp builds on the Pi without the HD2 register maps;
  leo_touch_transport.c (HD2 I2C) excluded on the Pi.
- pe_rpi3.c: pointer overlay; present copies the public tree's 480x800
  surface 1:1 (320x533 render-mode surfaces are still scaled).
---
